    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d595">

                <pb facs="0998" n="951" sameAs="frus:frus1955-57v03mSupp/pg951"/>

                <head>595. Telegram 6 from Geneva to Warsaw<anchor n="1" xml:id="d595-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Geneva</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1956-05-05">May 5, 1956, 4
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d595-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d595-1"/>
                <p>1849. From Johnson.</p>
                <p>Wang asked for postponement our May 5
                    meeting to May 11. Do you know of any development that would require his
                    presence in Warsaw during that period? He traveled to Warsaw April 27 presumably
                    attend May 1 celebration but I have not (repeat not) been able to determine
                    whether or when he returned Geneva.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Gowen</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
